    "Name": "Von Luckner",
    "Details": "Named for a legendary Terran raider, the Von Luckner was designed for the original Star League after the Reunification War. Few remain in service today. The Von Luckner was one of the few tanks to use a fusion engine, as most vehicle-mounted reactors were stripped out for use in 'Mechs during the Succession Wars.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Reactive Plating\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       275     40\n<b>Left</b>         210     40\n<b>Right</b>       210     40\n<b>Rear</b>        160     40\n<b>Turret</b>      260     40\n\n<b>Total</b>      1115    200</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "VonLuckner"
  },
  "YangsThoughts": "This heavily armored and armed vehicle was intended as a BattleMech without legs, fueled by a fusion reactor and equipped with enough firepower to threaten 'Mechs up to its own weight.",
